Modifications made for this repository:

  * Only the `frontend` service source is vendored here (`src/frontend`),
    taken from upstream release v0.10.7. All other services are consumed
    as prebuilt upstream container images.
  * Added `bunnyshell.yaml`, a Bunnyshell environment definition, to run
    the full application as an ephemeral environment.
  * The upstream Kubernetes manifests, Helm chart, Kustomize bases,
    Terraform and Istio configuration are not included.

